  good-friday-2037: once(2037-04-03) effective [2026-10-29, ..)
  good-friday-2038: once(2038-04-23) effective [2026-10-29, ..)
  good-friday-2039: once(2039-04-08) effective [2026-10-29, ..)
  good-friday-2040: once(2040-03-30) effective [2026-10-29, ..)
